<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18848" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄψ</span></b> , Adv. of Place, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπό,</span> Lat. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>abs) backwards, back again,</i> freq. in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, mostly with Verbs of motion, freq. before 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς, ἀπό, ἐκ, ἂ. ἐς Ὄλυμπον
					ἵκεσθον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					8.456
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				10.211
			</span></i>, etc.; with trans. Verbs, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἂ. ἐς κουλεὸν ὦσε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.220
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				15.418
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἂ. ἐπὶ νῆας ἔεργε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					16.395
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἂ. ἵππους στρέψαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					13.396
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				18.224
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of actions,
				<i>again, in return,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἂ. διδόναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					22.277
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἂ. ἀφελέσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					16.54
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἂ. ἀπολύειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					6.427
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἂ. ἀρέσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					9.120
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἂ. τέτατο ὑσμίνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					17.543
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἂ. ἐπιμισγομένων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					5.505
				</span></i>
			; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἂψ ἀπαγγ] εῖλαι</span> prob.
			in <i><span class="en">
				Epich.
				99
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἂ. λαμβάνειν,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναλαμβάνειν</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				25.65
			</span></i>: pleon., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἂ. αὖτις</span>
			<i>yet</i> again, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				8.335
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				15.364
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἂ. πάλιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					18.280
				</span></i>
			.</div>
